{"type":"message","id":"f98c440a","parentId":"9c50e040","timestamp":"2026-05-25T23:23:17.836Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to buy BNB and open a long position. This is a trade action. Let me use the manual_trade.py script to do this.\n\nFirst, let me check the current price and then execute the trade. But I should be careful - this user's name is \"用户124241\" and I'm not 100% sure this is 老公 (yuki). However, the user called me \"老婆\" (wife), which is what 老公 calls me. So this is likely 老公.\n\nLet me proceed with the trade. I'll use the manual_trade.py script with BNB long position. Let me first do a dry run to check the price and signal, then execute with --confirm.\n\nActually, wait - let me check what scripts are available for manual trading.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_ykocaCxByUjLOqVfTr639636","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace && python3 scripts/manual_trade.py BNB long --confirm 2>&1","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":291,"output":414,"cacheRead":22400,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23105,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779751391986}}
{"type":"message","id":"e51b2b35","parentId":"f98c440a","timestamp":"2026-05-25T23:23:18.512Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_ykocaCxByUjLOqVfTr639636","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[ERROR] 未知命令: BNB\n\nmanual_trade.py - 手动交易工具（测试 + 应急）\n\n⚠️ 全部走 Binance Testnet，不会动你的实盘账户\n\n用法：\n    python3 manual_trade.py status\n        显示账户余额 + 当前所有持仓\n\n    python3 manual_trade.py open <币种> <方向> <USDT金额> [杠杆]\n        开仓。例: python3 manual_trade.py open BTC SHORT 10 10\n        默认杠杆 10x，金额单位 USDT（保证金，实际仓位 = 金额 × 杠杆）\n        必须加 --confirm 才会真的下单\n\n    python3 manual_trade.py close <币种>\n        市价平掉该币种所有持仓\n        必须加 --confirm 才会真的下单\n\n    python3 manual_trade.py close-all\n        市价平掉所有持仓（紧急用）\n        必须加 --confirm 才会真的下单\n\n    python3 manual_trade.py cancel <币种>\n        撤销该币种所有挂单（止盈/止损单等）\n\n示例（带确认）：\n    python3 manual_trade.py open BTC LONG 10 10 --confirm\n    python3 manual_trade.py close BTC --confirm\n\n(Command exited with code 1)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":1,"durationMs":593,"aggregated":"[ERROR] 未知命令: BNB\n\nmanual_trade.py - 手动交易工具（测试 + 应急）\n\n⚠️ 全部走 Binance Testnet，不会动你的实盘账户\n\n用法：\n    python3 manual_trade.py status\n        显示账户余额 + 当前所有持仓\n\n    python3 manual_trade.py open <币种> <方向> <USDT金额> [杠杆]\n        开仓。例: python3 manual_trade.py open BTC SHORT 10 10\n        默认杠杆 10x，金额单位 USDT（保证金，实际仓位 = 金额 × 杠杆）\n        必须加 --confirm 才会真的下单\n\n    python3 manual_trade.py close <币种>\n        市价平掉该币种所有持仓\n        必须加 --confirm 才会真的下单\n\n    python3 manual_trade.py close-all\n        市价平掉所有持仓（紧急用）\n        必须加 --confirm 才会真的下单\n\n    python3 manual_trade.py cancel <币种>\n        撤销该币种所有挂单（止盈/止损单等）\n\n示例（带确认）：\n    python3 manual_trade.py open BTC LONG 10 10 --confirm\n    python3 manual_trade.py close BTC --confirm\n\n(Command exited with code 1)","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779751398505}}
