itCode":0,"durationMs":78,"aggregated":"5:优化：WebSocket实时价格 + 分层扫描 + 市场状态识别 + 移动止盈 + 熔断保护\n116:    \"binance_base\":    \"https://testnet.binancefuture.com/fapi/v1\",  # 测试网期货 K线接口\n117:    \"binance_futures\": \"https://testnet.binancefuture.com/fapi/v1\",  # 测试网期货接口\n147:# 一、WebSocket 实时价格流\n151:    Binance WebSocket 合并流，所有币种一个连接。\n157:        streams = \"/\".join([f\"{s.lower()}usdt@ticker\" for s in symbols])\n158:        # ✅ 2026-04-01 老公指示：改用测试网 WebSocket，和交易环境一致\n159:        self.url = f\"wss://stream.binancefuture.com/stream?streams={streams}\"\n176:                        log.info(\"WebSocket 价格流已连接 (aiohttp + 代理)\")\n198:                                log.warning(f\"WebSocket 错误：{ws.exception()}\")\n199:                                # 🔁 WebSocket 断连时，启动现货 API 兜底\n203:                log.warning(f\"WebSocket 断线，5 秒后重连：{e}\")\n212:        \"\"\"WebSocket 断连时，用测试网期货 API 兜底获取价格（每30秒一次）\"\"\"\n213:        log.warning(\"⚠️ WebSocket 断连，启动测试网期货 API 兜底...\")\n218:                        f'https://testnet.binancefuture.com/fapi/v1/ticker/price?symbol={sym}USDT',\n228:                        'source': 'futures_testnet_fallback',\n234:                            f'https://testnet.binancefuture.com/fapi/v1/ticker/24hr?symbol={sym}USDT',\n1327:    url = \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal\"\n1998:    price_stream = PriceStream(CONFIG[\"symbols\"], proxy=CONFIG[\"proxy\"])\n2012:    # 启动WebSocket（后台）\n2013:    asyncio.create_task(price_stream.start())\n2015:    # 等待WebSocket就绪\n2016:    log.info(\"等待WebSocket价格流就绪...\")\n2018:        if price_stream.is_ready():\n2021:    log.info(f\"价格流就绪: {list(price_stream.prices.keys())}\")\n2177:            prices = {sym: price_stream.get(sym) for sym in CONFIG[\"symbols\"]}","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779752766390}}
{"type":"message","id":"4c5c0db8","parentId":"bf0fec7b","timestamp":"2026-05-25T23:46:14.847Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The price source is:\n1. WebSocket: `wss://stream.binancefuture.com/stream` - Binance Futures testnet WebSocket\n2. Fallback: `https://testnet.binancefuture.com/fapi/v1/ticker/price` - Binance Futures testnet REST API\n\nAll prices come from Binance Futures Testnet. But wait - testnet prices should roughly track real market prices since they're based on the same index. Testnet futures prices are usually pegged to real futures prices via mark price/index price mechanisms.\n\nSo the answer: we use Binance Futures Testnet (testnet.binancefuture.com), which is the testnet futures market. The prices there should mirror real market prices via the index price mechanism, but during testnet backend issues like now, they can freeze.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"价格全部来自 **Binance Futures Testnet（测试网）**：\n\n- **WebSocket 实时流**：`wss://stream.binancefuture.com` — 订阅 7 个币种的 ticker 数据\n- **断线兜底**：`testnet.binancefuture.com/fapi/v1` REST API，30 秒一次\n\n测试网的期货合约价格通常锚定实盘的标记价格/指数价格，所以正常情况下跟实盘走势基本一致。但像现在测试网后端崩了的话，WebSocket 推的数据也僵住了，自然就看不出波动——不是你看到的 1s 线拉平吗，对得上。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":620,"output":482,"cacheRead":27776,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":28878,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779752766414}}
