{"type":"message","id":"de567b8a","parentId":"8281a130","timestamp":"2026-05-26T00:12:43.617Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"There are automatic pause mechanisms:\n1. Circuit breaker: daily loss >10% → pause 4 hours\n2. Consecutive losses → pause 2 hours\n3. News-based suspension: negative news → pause specific symbol for 2 hours\n\nBut there doesn't seem to be a manual pause/resume toggle that the user can trigger. The circuit breaker can be cleared with `circuit_breaker.clear()` and at line 2097 there's `circuit_breaker.paused_until = None` in initialization.\n\nSo we have automatic trading pause mechanisms but no manual on/off switch for the user to say \"stop all trading now\" or \"resume trading.\" The user might be asking if we have one specifically for when testnet is down.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"有自动熔断，没有手动暂停开关。\n\n现有的三个自动暂停：\n\n| 触发条件 | 动作 |\n|---|---|\n| 日亏损 >10% | 暂停 4 小时 |\n| 连续亏损 | 暂停 2 小时 |\n| 负面新闻 | 该币种暂停 2 小时 |\n\n但像现在测试网崩了这种情况，需要一个「手动暂停/恢复交易」的开关。要不要我加一个？一行命令就能关停/重开，不用改代码或者 kj restart。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":513,"output":419,"cacheRead":31232,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":32164,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779754356641}}
