{"type":"message","id":"2b4ab23b","parentId":"b0517bdb","timestamp":"2026-05-26T04:37:52.889Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_ZRqflxa4nTVISoKnuMgn1219","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"def calc_score(\n    symbol: str,\n    price_data: dict,\n    ind: dict,\n    regime: str,\n    fg: int,\n    funding_rate: float,\n    btc_ind: dict,  # 2026-03-28 老公指示：用 BTC 作为大盘参考\n) -> tuple[int, str]:\n    \"\"\"\n    返回 (score, direction)\n    direction: 'LONG' | 'SHORT' | 'NONE'\n    \"\"\"\n    if not ind or not price_data:\n        return 0, \"NONE\"\n\n    price      = float(price_data.get(\"price\") or ind.get(\"last_close\") or 0)\n    # 成交量：优先 15m K 线 vol_current（与 vol_avg20 同量纲），避免 WS 24h 量纲不一致\n    vol        = float(ind.get(\"vol_current\") or price_data.get(\"volume\") or 0)\n    vol_avg    = ind[\"vol_avg20\"]\n    atr_pct    = ind[\"atr_pct\"]\n    resistance = ind[\"resistance\"]\n    support    = ind[\"support\"]\n\n    long_score  = 0\n    short_score = 0\n\n    # ① 价格突破（40 分）\n    if price >= resistance * 0.999:\n        long_score += 40\n    if price <= support * 1.001:\n        short_score += 40\n\n    # ② 成交量放大确认（30 分）\n    if vol > vol_avg * 1.5:\n        long_score  += 30\n        short_score += 30\n    elif vol > vol_avg * 1.2:\n        long_score  += 15\n        short_score += 15\n\n    # ③ ATR 波动率适中（20 分）\n    if 0.005 < atr_pct < 0.03:\n        long_score  += 20\n        short_score += 20\n\n    # ④ BTC 大盘方向（10 分）- 2026-03-28 老公指示：用 BTC 代替 ETH\n    _btc = btc_ind if btc_ind else {}\n    if _btc:\n        btc_bull = _btc.get(\"ema20_15m\", 0) > _btc.get(\"ema60_15m\", 0)\n\n[1890 more lines in file. Use offset=543 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779770272868}}
{"type":"message","id":"b05b769c","parentId":"2b4ab23b","timestamp":"2026-05-26T04:38:00.671Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This scoring function needs `ind` (indicator data) and other parameters that are computed live. It depends on `IndicatorEngine`, `SentimentEngine`, etc. I can't easily run it standalone without the full monitor context.\n\nLet me try a different approach - run the hourly report function that computes all scores, or look at the monitor's running process to see current scores.\n\nActually, let me try to import and call the hourly_report function with the current state data. Or I can look for the function that pushes scores to Feishu.\n\nActually, the simplest approach might be to just check the monitor's stdout or recent Feishu messages for scores. But since there are no log files...\n\nLet me try running a standalone score computation. I'll need to import the indicator engine and create the necessary data structures.\n\nActually wait - let me check if there's a way to grab the indicator data from the running monitor process. The process has PID 32732.\n\nAlternatively, I can try calling the hourly report function with current data. Let me look at how calculate_hourly_report works.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_yV9OA8PIinq42WYcIb9g3380","name":"read","arguments":{"offset":1564,"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","limit":80}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":619,"output":537,"cacheRead":42368,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":43524,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779770272910}}
{"type":"message","id":"4e3c8b40","parentId":"b05b769c","timestamp":"2026-05-26T04:38:00.725Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_yV9OA8PIinq42WYcIb9g3380","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"    \"\"\"整点汇报评分：价格/成交量与指标引擎同源\"\"\"\n    price = float(pd.get(\"price\") or ind.get(\"last_close\") or 0)\n    return {\n        \"price\": price,\n        \"volume\": float(ind.get(\"vol_current\") or pd.get(\"volume\") or 0),\n        \"change_24h\": float(pd.get(\"change_24h\", 0) or 0),\n    }\n\n\ndef _regime_label(regime: str) -> str:\n    return {\"trending\": \"趋势\", \"ranging\": \"震荡\", \"volatile\": \"高波动\"}.get(regime, regime)\n\n\ndef _format_hourly_score_line(symbol: str, pd: dict, ind: dict, regime: str, fg: int, fr: float, btc_ind: dict) -> str:\n    \"\"\"整点汇报单行：评分 + RSI + 市场状态（与飞书问答表格一致）\"\"\"\n    score_pd = _price_data_for_score(symbol, pd, ind)\n    score, direction = calc_score(symbol, score_pd, ind, regime, fg, fr, btc_ind)\n    rsi = ind.get(\"rsi\", 0)\n    return f\"{score}分 RSI{rsi:.0f} {_regime_label(regime)} → {direction}\"\n\n\ndef prepare_hourly_report_data(\n    prices: dict,\n    indicators: dict,\n    indicator_engine: Optional[\"IndicatorEngine\"] = None,\n) -> tuple[dict, dict]:\n    \"\"\"\n    整点汇报前强制刷新：价格涨跌幅 + 全币种指标。\n    避免整点时刻 indicators 未更新、change_24h 为 0、评分为 0。\n    \"\"\"\n    prices = _normalize_price_data(prices)\n    ticker_map = _fetch_24h_tickers()\n    for sym, tk in ticker_map.items():\n        if sym not in prices:\n            prices[sym] = {}\n        if tk.get(\"price\", 0) > 0:\n            prices[sym][\"price\"] = tk[\"price\"]\n        prices[sym][\"change_24h\"] = tk.get(\"change_24h\", prices[sym].get(\"change_24h\", 0))\n        if not prices[sym].get(\"volume\"):\n            prices[sym][\"volume\"] = tk.get(\"volume\", 0)\n\n    engine = indicator_engine or IndicatorEngine()\n    refreshed = {}\n    for sym in CONFIG[\"symbols\"]:\n        ind = engine.calc(sym)\n        if ind:\n            refreshed[sym] = ind\n            if sym in prices and ind.get(\"last_close\"):\n                prices[sym][\"price\"] = float(ind[\"last_close\"])\n                prices[sym][\"volume\"] = float(ind.get(\"vol_current\") or prices[sym].get(\"volume\") or 0)\n    if refreshed:\n        indicators = refreshed\n        log.info(f\"📋 整点汇报已刷新指标：{len(refreshed)}/{len(CONFIG['symbols'])} 个币种\")\n    else:\n        log.warning(\"⚠️ 整点汇报指标刷新失败，评分可能为 0\")\n\n    return prices, indicators\n\n\ndef push_hourly_report(\n    positions: list,\n    prices: dict,\n    indicators: dict,\n    daily_pnl: float,\n    fg: int,\n    indicator_engine: Optional[\"IndicatorEngine\"] = None,\n):\n    \"\"\"推送整点汇报（显示所有币种的价格和评分）\"\"\"\n    prices, indicators = prepare_hourly_report_data(prices, indicators, indicator_engine)\n    btc_ind = indicators.get(\"BTC\", {})\n\n    # 恐惧贪婪描述\n    if fg < 25:\n        fg_text = \"极度恐惧\"\n        fg_color = \"🔴\"\n    elif fg < 40:\n        fg_text = \"恐惧\"\n        fg_color = \"🟠\"\n    elif fg < 60:\n        fg_text = \"中性\"\n\n[789 more lines in file. Use offset=1644 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779770280711}}
{"type":"message","id":"2188d06c","parentId":"4e3c8b40","timestamp":"2026-05-26T04:38:10.208Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me try to run a standalone score computation. I'll need to:\n1. Import the necessary classes and functions\n2. Fetch 24h tickers for the indicator data\n3. Compute scores for each symbol\n\nLet me try to write a small script.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_tXHu3VpbpOUVaCPw4FON3023","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport sys, json\nsys.path.insert(0, '.')\n\nimport crypto_signal_monitor as m\n\n# 刷新指标\nengine = m.IndicatorEngine()\nprices_raw = {}\nticker_map = m._fetch_24h_tickers()\n\nfor sym in m.CONFIG['symbols']:\n    ind = engine.calc(sym)\n    if ind:\n        price_data = {'price': ind.get('last_close', 0)}\n        if sym in ticker_map:\n            price_data['change_24h'] = ticker_map[sym]['change_24h']\n            price_data['volume'] = ticker_map[sym]['volume']\n        else:\n            price_data['change_24h'] = 0\n            price_data['volume'] = 0\n        \n        btc_ind = {} if sym == 'BTC' else (indicators.get('BTC', {}))\n        \n        score, direction = m.calc_score(\n            sym, price_data, ind,\n            regime=m.CONFIG.get('default_regime', 'ranging'),\n            fg=50, funding_rate=0.0,\n            btc_ind=indicators.get('BTC', {})\n        )\n        regime = m._regime_label(m.CONFIG.get('default_regime', 'ranging'))\n        rsi = ind.get('rsi', 0)\n        print(f'{sym:5s} \\${price_data[\\\"price\\\"]:>10.4f}  评分 {score:>3}/100  RSI{rsi:.0f}  {regime}  → {direction}')\n\" 2>&1","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":926,"output":525,"cacheRead":43264,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":44715,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","times