{"type":"message","id":"5e0e4fd3","parentId":"d80b9780","timestamp":"2026-05-26T07:17:41.978Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about the stop-loss and take-profit strategy. Let me check the SOUL.md and the monitor code for the current strategy details.\n\nFrom SOUL.md I already have this:\n\n### 三档移动止盈（全部平仓）\n| 档位 | 利润 | 锁定 | 说明 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| 第1档 | +2% | 0.8% | 保底 |\n| 第2档 | +3% | 2% | ⭐️ |\n| 第3档 | +4% | 全部平仓 | 落袋为安 |\n\n### 智能止盈止损\n止盈 = min(阻力位, 价格×(1+ATR×1.5×RSI因子), 24h高点)\n止损 = max(支撑位×0.995, 价格×(1-ATR×分层倍数), 24h低点×0.98)\nATR倍数: <2%→1.0, <4%→1.5, ≥4%→2.0\n保底: 止盈≥+3%, 止损≤-3%, 盈亏比≥1.5:1\n\nLet me also check the actual implementation in the code to make sure this is current.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_rF983UW3oEaVBDOI7SLV3370","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -n 'def.*sl\\|def.*tp\\|def.*stop\\|def.*take\\|def.*止盈\\|def.*止损\\|trailing\\|移动止盈' /root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py | head -20","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":333,"output":670,"cacheRead":48256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":49259,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779779854112}}
{"type":"message","id":"229a491d","parentId":"5e0e4fd3","timestamp":"2026-05-26T07:17:42.177Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_rF983UW3oEaVBDOI7SLV3370","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"5:优化：WebSocket实时价格 + 分层扫描 + 市场状态识别 + 移动止盈 + 熔断保护\n79:    # 移动止盈 - 2026-03-30 老公指示：关闭移动止盈，严格固定 -2% 止损\n80:    # 2026-03-30 老公指示：三档移动止盈（回撤比例）\n81:    \"trailing_tiers\": [\n562:def calc_tp_sl(\n589:        \"peak_pnl\":  0.0,   # 移动止盈用\n634:def update_trailing_stop(positions: list, prices: dict):\n636:    移动止盈 - 2026-03-30 老公指示：三档移动止盈（从峰值价回撤）\n662:        for tier in CONFIG[\"trailing_tiers\"]:\n698:def sync_stop_loss_to_binance(symbol: str, typ: str, new_sl: float, old_sl: float):\n2104:    # 应用恢复的 peak_pnl 到持仓（移动止盈关键数据）\n2213:            # 移动止盈更新\n2214:            update_trailing_stop(positions, prices)\n2407:            # 保存状态（包含 peak_pnl 用于移动止盈）"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":159,"aggregated":"5:优化：WebSocket实时价格 + 分层扫描 + 市场状态识别 + 移动止盈 + 熔断保护\n79:    # 移动止盈 - 2026-03-30 老公指示：关闭移动止盈，严格固定 -2% 止损\n80:    # 2026-03-30 老公指示：三档移动止盈（回撤比例）\n81:    \"trailing_tiers\": [\n562:def calc_tp_sl(\n589:        \"peak_pnl\":  0.0,   # 移动止盈用\n634:def update_trailing_stop(positions: list, prices: dict):\n636:    移动止盈 - 2026-03-30 老公指示：三档移动止盈（从峰值价回撤）\n662:        for tier in CONFIG[\"trailing_tiers\"]:\n698:def sync_stop_loss_to_binance(symbol: str, typ: str, new_sl: float, old_sl: float):\n2104:    # 应用恢复的 peak_pnl 到持仓（移动止盈关键数据）\n2213:            # 移动止盈更新\n2214:            update_trailing_stop(positions, prices)\n2407:            # 保存状态（包含 peak_pnl 用于移动止盈）","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779779862171}}
{"type":"message","id":"78f956d5","parentId":"229a491d","timestamp":"2026-05-26T07:17:46.212Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me look at the actual calc_tp_sl function and trailing stop implementation to give an accurate answer.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_y9Btd6ZKrytdReueKdqJ4719","name":"read","arguments":{"offset":562,"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","limit":80}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_o2GRDMV2V6QzpjI0oCvC7722","name":"read","arguments":{"offset":634,"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","limit":70}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":387,"output":214,"cacheRead":48896,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":49497,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779779862190}}
{"type":"message","id":"e5d76c85","parentId":"78f956d5","timestamp":"2026-05-26T07:17:46.363Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_y9Btd6ZKrytdReueKdqJ4719","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"def calc_tp_sl(\n    entry: float,\n    direction: str,\n    ind: dict,\n    price_data: dict,\n) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"\n    返回 {tp1, sl}\n    \n    2026-03-28 老公指示：固定百分比止盈止损 + 全平\n    - 止盈：+4%（TP1 全平 100%）\n    - 止损：-2%\n    - 无 TP2（已废弃）\n    \"\"\"\n    TAKE_PROFIT_PCT = 0.04  # 2026-03-30 老公指示：改回 4%（8U）\n    STOP_LOSS_PCT   = 0.01  # 保持 1%\n    \n    if direction == \"LONG\":\n        tp1 = entry * (1 + TAKE_PROFIT_PCT)  # 做多 +4%\n        sl  = entry * (1 - STOP_LOSS_PCT)    # 做多 -1%\n    else:\n        tp1 = entry * (1 - TAKE_PROFIT_PCT)  # 做空 -4%\n        sl  = entry * (1 + STOP_LOSS_PCT)    # 做空 +1%\n\n    return {\n        \"tp1_price\": round(tp1, 4),\n        \"sl_price\":  round(sl, 4),\n        \"peak_pnl\":  0.0,   # 移动止盈用\n    }\n\n\n# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n# 七、止盈止损检查（15秒必跑，极轻量）\n# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\ndef check_exits_fast(positions: list, prices: dict) -> list[tuple]:\n    \"\"\"\n    返回 [(position, reason, close_size_ratio)]\n    纯价格比较，无任何计算，<5ms\n    \n    2026-03-28 老公指示：TP1 全平，无 TP2\n    \"\"\"\n    exits = []\n    for pos in positions:\n        sym = pos[\"symbol\"]\n        p   = prices.get(sym, {}).get(\"price\")\n        if not p:\n            continue\n\n        tp1 = pos[\"tp1_price\"]\n        sl  = pos[\"sl_price\"]\n        \n        # 跳过止盈止损为 0 的无效持仓\n        if tp1 == 0.0 or sl == 0.0:\n            log.warning(f\"⚠️ {sym} 止盈止损无效 (TP1={tp1}, SL={sl})，跳过检查\")\n            continue\n        \n        typ = pos[\"type\"]\n\n        if typ == \"LONG\":\n            if p >= tp1:\n                exits.append((pos, \"TP1\", 1.0))  # 全平\n            elif p <= sl:\n                exits.append((pos, \"SL\", 1.0))   # 全平\n        else:  # SHORT\n            if p <= tp1:\n                exits.append((pos, \"TP1\", 1.0))  # 全平\n            elif p >= sl:\n                exits.append((pos, \"SL\", 1.0))   # 全平\n\n    return exits\n\n\ndef update_trailing_stop(positions: list, prices: dict):\n    \"\"\"\n    移动止盈 - 2026-03-30 老公指示：三档移动止盈（从峰值价回撤）\n    2% → 回撤 0.8% → 锁定 1.2%\n    3% → 回撤 1% → 锁定 2% ⭐️ 老公指示\n    4% → 全平\n    \n    2026-03-31 老公指示：每次更新 sl_price 后同步到 Binance（取消旧单 + 提交新单）\n\n[1791 more lines in file. Use offset=642 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779779866351}}
{"type":"message","id":"a01b1aac","parentId":"e5d76c85","timestamp":"2026-05-26T07:17:46.381Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_01_o2GRDMV2V6QzpjI0oCvC7722","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"def update_trailing_stop(positions: list, prices: dict):\n    \"\"\"\n    移动止盈 - 2026-03-30 老公指示：三档移动止盈（从峰值价回撤）\n    2% → 回撤 0.8% → 锁定 1.2%\n    3% → 回撤 1% → 锁定 2% ⭐️ 老公指示\n    4% → 全平\n    \n    2026-03-31 老公指示：每次更新 sl_price 后同步到 Binance（取消旧单 + 提交新单）\n    \"\"\"\n    for pos in positions:\n        sym = pos[\"symbol\"]\n        p   = prices.get(sym, {}).get(\"price\")\n        if not p:\n            continue\n\n        entry = pos[\"entry_price\"]\n        typ   = pos[\"type\"]\n\n        pnl_pct = (p - entry) / entry if typ == \"LONG\" else (entry - p) / entry\n\n        # 更新峰值盈亏 和 峰值价格\n        if pnl_pct > pos.get(\"peak_pnl\", 0):\n            pos[\"peak_pnl\"] = pnl_pct\n            pos[\"peak_price\"] = p  # ✅ 记录峰值价格\n\n        # 找到当前利润对应的档位（取最高档）\n        active_tier = None\n        peak_pnl = pos.get(\"peak_pnl\", 0)  # ✅ 兼容旧数据\n        for tier in CONFIG[\"trailing_tiers\"]:\n            if peak_pnl >= tier[\"pnl\"]:\n                active_tier = tier\n            else:\n                break\n\n        if not active_tier:\n            continue\n\n        # 4% 全平特殊处理\n        if active_tier.get(\"gap\", 0) >= 0.9:\n            old_sl = pos[\"sl_price\"]\n            pos[\"sl_price\"] = p * 0.999 if typ == \"LONG\" else p * 1.001\n            # 同步到 Binance\n            sync_stop_loss_to_binance(sym, typ, pos[\"sl_price\"], old_sl)\n            continue\n        \n        # 回撤比例（老公指示）- 从峰值价回撤！\n        gap = active_tier[\"gap\"]\n        peak_p = pos.get(\"peak_price\", entry)  # ✅ 用峰值价，不是当前价\n        \n        if typ == \"LONG\":\n            new_sl = peak_p * (1 - gap)  # 峰值价回撤 gap%\n            if new_sl > pos[\"sl_price\"]:\n                old_sl = pos[\"sl_price\"]\n                pos[\"sl_price\"] = round(new_sl, 4)\n                # 同步到 Binance（取消旧单 + 提交新单）\n                sync_stop_loss_to_binance(sym, typ, pos[\"sl_price\"], old_sl)\n        else:\n            new_sl = peak_p * (1 + gap)  # 峰值价回撤 gap%\n            if new_sl < pos[\"sl_price\"]:\n                old_sl = pos[\"sl_price\"]\n                pos[\"sl_price\"] = round(new_sl, 4)\n                # 同步到 Binance（取消旧单 + 提交新单）\n                sync_stop_loss_to_binance(sym, typ, pos[\"sl_price\"], old_sl)\n\ndef sync_stop_loss_to_binance(symbol: str, typ: str, new_sl: float, old_sl: float):\n    \"\"\"\n    2026-03-31 老公指示：同步止损价到 Binance\n    取消旧止损单 + 提交新止损单\n    \"\"\"\n    try:\n\n[1729 more lines in file. Use offset=704 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779779866368}}
{"type":"message","id":"cf9994b8","parentId":"a01b1aac","timestamp":"2026-05-26T07:17:55.361Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the full picture. Let me summarize the strategy clearly:\n\nFixed TP/SL:\n- TP: ±4% (all-in close)\n- SL: ±1%\n\nTrailing stop (three tiers, based on peak PnL):\n- 2% profit → 0.8% pullback → lock 1.2%\n- 3% profit → 1% pullback → lock 2% ⭐️ (老公's instruction)\n- 4% profit → full close\n\nThe trailing stop updates sl_price in real time and syncs to Binance (cancel old stop order + place new one).","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"现在的策略分两层：\n\n**固定止盈止损**\n- 止盈 TP：±4%（全平，落袋为安）\n- 止损 SL：±1%\n\n**三档移动止盈（从峰值价回撤）**\n\n| 档位 | 利润到 | 回撤 | 锁定 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 第1档 | +2% | 0.8% | 保底 1.2% |\n| 第2档 | +3% | 1% | 锁定 2% ⭐️ |\n| 第3档 | +4% | — | 全平 |\n\n逻辑是：开仓后先走固定止盈止损，一旦利润跑到 2% 就启动移动止盈——从峰值计算回撤幅度来不断往上推 SL。到 4% 直接平光不犹豫。\n\n每次移动止盈更新 SL 都会自动同步到币安（取消旧止损单 + 提交新单），不用人工干预。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1738,"output":467,"cacheRead":49408,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":51613,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779779866387}}
