{"type":"message","id":"c21f6c14","parentId":"8cfa53f8","timestamp":"2026-05-26T07:19:56.158Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking what the starting balance was. Let me check - from the earlier health check, the balance was 4975.18 USDT. And from the first status check earlier today, it was 4975.18.\n\nActually, I should clarify what \"最开始\" means. The user probably means the starting balance of this account, or the balance at the beginning of this session/day. Let me check what I have.\n\nFrom memory/context:\n- Initial capital should be 100 USDT (Testnet) based on SOUL.md risk management\n- But the balance was already 4975.18 when we first checked today at 07:22 GMT+8\n\nWait, that doesn't match. 100 USDT initial but 4975 USDT balance? That's testnet with a large balance. The risk management says \"总资金 100 USDT\" but the actual testnet account has ~5000 USDT.\n\nLet me just tell the user what I know - today's first check showed 4975.18 USDT balance, now it's 5003.70.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"今天我们第一次查的时候（7:22）余额是 4975.18，现在 5003.70，还多了 $28.52。3 个单止损小亏，但不影响本金。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":374,"output":496,"cacheRead":52736,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":53606,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779779987724}}
{"type":"message","id":"cd63768a","parentId":"c21f6c14","timestamp":"2026-05-26T07:20:12.364Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e60d47dac90b4b1c0e9d5e22a8\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户124241\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-05-26 15:20 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户124241 (ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"name\": \"用户124241\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e60d47dac90b4b1c0e9d5e22a8]\n用户124241: 1%会不会太少"}],"timestamp":1779780012339}}
{"type":"message","id":"a446e29d","parentId":"cd63768a","timestamp":"2026-05-26T07:20:26.577Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is questioning whether the 1% stop loss is too tight. Let me give a thoughtful answer.\n\nLooking at the current code:\n- SL: 1% (from `STOP_LOSS_PCT = 0.01`)\n- TP: 4%\n\nThe risk-reward ratio is 1:4, which is good on paper. But in practice with crypto volatility, 1% SL is extremely tight. Let me think about this.\n\nWith 10x leverage, a 1% price move = 10% of the margin gone. With 20 USDT margin, that's $2 loss per position. \n\nFor reference - the current atr_pct values and general volatility of these coins... 1% is basically noise in crypto. Especially in ranging markets where there's a lot of noise trading, you'll get stopped out constantly.\n\nBut the user set this deliberately. I should give my honest opinion but not push too hard. Let me point out the tradeoffs:\n- 1% SL with 10x leverage = 10% of margin, which is tight\n- Risk-reward is 1:4 which is good\n- But crypto noise alone can trigger 1% moves easily\n- Maybe suggest 1.5-2% as a middle ground\n\nLet me be direct - in crypto, 1% is really tight. But it's the user's decision.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"以 10 倍杠杆来说，1% 回撤等于每单亏 $2（保证金的 10%），绝对金额不大。但问题出在胜率上——加密波动率本身就高，震荡行情里 1% 的噪音反弹太容易触发，像刚才四单空三个被扫就是例子。\n\n**1% SL 的问题：**\n- 盈亏比 4:1 看着漂亮，但实际胜率太低，经常扫出去\n- 震荡行情里反复止损，小刀割肉\n\n**建议考虑调到 1.5%-2%：**\n- 杠杆下还是扛得住（单笔最大亏 $3-4）\n- 能过滤掉大部分噪音反弹\n- 盈亏比降到 2:1 还能接受\n\n要不要改？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":454,"output":744,"cacheRead":52992,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":54190,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779780012355}}
