{"type":"message","id":"f6442f31","parentId":"263691da","timestamp":"2026-05-26T07:22:21.721Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting! At line 2158, there's a hardcoded `0.008` for SL in this fallback recovery code. This is separate from the main calc_tp_sl function – it only runs when recovering positions from API data that are missing fields. Still, for consistency it should be updated to 0.02.\n\nLet me now look at what the comment at 2048 says – it mentions \"2%/1%\" but those are wrong numbers (TP used to be 2%, now 4%). The comment is outdated but harmless.\n\nSummary of files to change:\n\n1. **`scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py`** — the one and only file:\n   - Line 576: `STOP_LOSS_PCT = 0.01` → `0.02`\n   - Line 577: comment `# 保持 1%` → `# 2%`\n   - Line 581: comment `# 做多 -1%` → `# 做多 -2%`\n   - Line 584: comment `# 做空 +1%` → `# 做空 +2%`\n   - Line 573: comment `- 止损：-2%` → `- 止损：-1%` (no wait, it already says -2%, which is inconsistent with the 1% SL... Let me re-read)\n   \n   Actually let me re-read. Line 573 says `- 止损：-2%` but STOP_LOSS_PCT is 0.01. So the comment is already saying -2% even though the code uses 1%. The comment was probably from an earlier version. Let me fix the comment to be consistent.\n\n   Wait, actually: the comment says \"止损：-2%\" but the code says `STOP_LOSS_PCT = 0.01`. They're inconsistent. Currently it's 1% in the code. The user wants to change to 2%. So after the change, the comment \"-2%\" would be correct!\n\n   - Line 576: `STOP_LOSS_PCT = 0.01` → `0.02`\n   - Line 577: comment `# 保持 1%` → `# 2%`  \n   - Line 581: `sl = entry * (1 - STOP_LOSS_PCT)` — this uses the variable, no change needed\n   - Line 581 comment: `# 做多 -1%` → `# 做多 -2%`\n   - Line 584: `sl = entry * (1 + STOP_LOSS_PCT)` — this uses the variable, no change needed\n   - Line 584 comment: `# 做空 +1%` → `# 做空 +2%`\n   - Line 2048: comment about \"1%\" → update\n   - Line 2069: comment `# 新 1% 止损` → `# 新 2% 止损`\n   - Line 2158: hardcoded `0.008` → `0.02`\n   - Line 2158 comment: needs updating\n   - Line 2333: `if pnl_pct < -0.01 and time.time() - last_trigger > 7200:` — this is for emergency shutdown check, not SL. Should probably be updated to -0.02 to match.\n\nAlso need to check SOUL.md which has the strategy documented.\n\nLet me be thorough and check line 2333 too.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"分析完了。**只有一个文件需要改：`scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py`**，共 5 处：\n\n| 行号 | 内容 | 改法 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 573 | 注释 `止损：-2%` | 已经是 -2%，不动 |\n| 576 | **`STOP_LOSS_PCT = 0.01`** | → `0.02`（核心改动） |\n| 577 | 注释 `# 保持 1%` | → `# 2%` |\n| 581 | 注释 `# 做多 -1%` | → `# 做多 -2%` |\n| 584 | 注释 `# 做空 +1%` | → `# 做空 +2%` |\n| 2048 | 注释 `（2%/1%）` | → `（4%/2%）` |\n| 2069 | 注释 `# 新 1% 止损` | → `# 新 2% 止损` |\n| 2158 | **硬编码 `0.008`** | → `0.02`（恢复持仓时的兜底 SL） |\n| 2333 | **硬编码 `-0.01`** | → `-0.02`（紧急熔断阈值） |\n\n`manual_trade.py` 和 `binance_auto_trade.py` 不自己计算 SL，都是从 `calc_tp_sl` 拿结果，所以不用动。要我现在改吗？改完需要 `kj restart` 生效。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":353,"output":1824,"cacheRead":56704,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":58881,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779780122539}}
{"type":"message","id":"65848100","parentId":"f6442f31","timestamp":"2026-05-26T07:23:50.532Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e60e69c40a0b2faa0f6db86bdc\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户124241\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-05-26 15:23 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户124241 (ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"name\": \"用户124241\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e60e69c40a0b2faa0f6db86bdc]\n用户124241: 会不会影响到移动止盈止损的回撤收割"}],"timestamp":1779780230514}}
{"type":"message","id":"36cca2eb","parentId":"65848100","timestamp":"2026-05-26T07:24:11.730Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking whether changing the stop loss percentage from 1% to 2% will affect the trailing stop mechanism. Let me think about how the two interact.\n\nThe trailing stop is independent - it's triggered by profit levels (2%, 3%, 4% from entry), and updates the SL price directly on the position object. It doesn't reference STOP_LOSS_PCT at all.\n\nThe initial SL is set by calc_tp_sl() using STOP_LOSS_PCT. The trailing stop then overwrites it with a tighter SL as profit increases. So changing STOP_LOSS_PCT from 0.01 to 0.02:\n\n1. Initial SL: wider (2% instead of 1%) - gives more room for noise\n2. Trailing stop: once profit hits 2%, it activates and starts pulling SL up from the peak price - this is independent of the initial SL value\n3. The trailing stop tiers (2%/3%/4% profit, with 0.8%/1%/full pullback) are NOT affected\n\nThe only interaction: since the initial SL is now at 2%, the trailing stop's first tier won't activate until profit exceeds 2% (same as before, but now the initial SL is also at ~that level, so there's a smoother transition).\n\nActually wait, let me re-check. The trailing stop activates when peak_pnl >= tier[\"pnl\"]. The tiers are:\n- pnl: 0.02 (2%)\n- pnl: 0.03 (3%)\n- pnl: 0.04 (4%)\n\nSo the first trailing tier activates at 2% profit. But now the initial SL is also at 2%. So:\n- If price goes 2% in your favor, the trailing stop kicks in and starts pushing SL up\n- But the initial SL is already at 2%... so there's an overlap\n\nActually, this is fine. The trailing stop will push SL to be tighter than the initial SL as profit increases. The flow would be:\n1. Entry → initial SL at 2% away\n2. Price moves to 2% profit → trailing stop first tier activates, moves SL to lock in some profit\n3. Price moves to 3% profit → second tier, tighter SL\n4. Price moves to 4% profit → full close\n\nNo real conflict. The trailing stop is unaffected because it works on peak_pnl and tiers, not on STOP_LOSS_PCT.\n\nBut wait, there might be an edge case. Let me check if the trailing stop compares against the current SL. Let me re-read the code:\n\nFor LONG:\n```python\nnew_sl = peak_p * (1 - gap)  # 峰值价回撤 gap%\nif new_sl > pos[\"sl_price\"]:  # only update if new SL is higher (tighter)\n    pos[\"sl_price\"] = new_sl\n```\n\nSo the trailing stop only moves SL up if the new SL is higher (better for LONG). With initial SL at 2% away, if the first tier pulls it back to 0.8% from peak, that's a tighter SL, so it will be applied. No problem.\n\nI'm fairly confident there's no impact. Let me double-check the emergency shutdown at line 2333 though.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"不影响。移动止盈的逻辑是独立的分层触发，不依赖 `STOP_LOSS_PCT`：\n\n```\n第1档 利润≥2% → 从峰值回撤0.8% → 推SL\n第2档 利润≥3% → 从峰值回撤1% → 推SL  \n第3档 利润≥4% → 全平\n```\n\n它的判断依据是 **peak_pnl（峰值盈利比例）** 和 **trailing_tiers 配置**，初始 SL 设多宽都不影响这三档什么时候激活、怎么推。\n\n唯一的微小变化：初始 SL 从 1% 拉宽到 2%，第 1 档触发时利润也是 2%，两者刚好重合——价格跑到 2% 不触发止损而是进入移动止盈第一档，逻辑上没冲突。\n\n第 2158 行的 `0.008` 和第 2333 行的 `-0.01` 是灾难恢复和熔断用的，改了也不碰移动止盈。放心改。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":321,"output":1603,"cacheRead":58112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":60036,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779780230529}}
