{"type":"message","id":"b08cd0a3","parentId":"aa001a87","timestamp":"2026-05-26T07:25:00.203Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking what \"SL\" means.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"SL = **Stop Loss**，止损。价格反向走到设定位置就自动平仓，防止亏损扩大。\n\n做多时 SL 在入场价下方，做空时在入场价上方。改完之后：做多跌 2% 止损，做空涨 2% 止损。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":573,"output":83,"cacheRead":58368,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":59024,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779780296610}}
