{"type":"message","id":"6a3d3c6b","parentId":"bcbed260","timestamp":"2026-05-26T07:29:28.512Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking whether changing just this one file (crypto_signal_monitor.py) would affect the ability to place orders. \n\nLet me think about this:\n\n1. `crypto_signal_monitor.py` is the signal monitor - it computes scores, generates signals, and automatically places orders.\n2. `manual_trade.py` is the manual trading tool.\n3. `binance_auto_trade.py` is the order execution module.\n\nThe STOP_LOSS_PCT change is only in `crypto_signal_monitor.py`, inside `calc_tp_sl()`. This function computes TP/SL prices when:\n- Signal monitor auto-opens a position\n- Manual trade opens via `manual_trade.py` (if it uses calc_tp_sl - let me check)\n\nActually, let me check if `manual_trade.py` uses `calc_tp_sl`. Earlier I found that manual_trade.py doesn't reference tp_sl directly. It might be calling `binance_auto_trade.py` directly.\n\nLet me also check if there's any other place that defines STOP_LOSS_PCT or has a hardcoded 1% stop loss.\n\nThe key question is: does changing STOP_LOSS_PCT in `calc_tp_sl` affect how orders are placed?\n\n- The signal monitor uses `calc_tp_sl` to determine TP and SL prices when opening positions\n- These TP/SL prices are then passed to `binance_auto_trade.py` which places the actual stop/take-profit orders on Binance\n- So changing 1%→2% here would mean new positions get 2% SL\n\nThe user is asking if this affects \"委托订单的开单\" - which I think means, does changing the SL percentage affect the order submission flow? The answer is: no, it only changes what SL price is calculated. The order submission flow is in `binance_auto_trade.py` and `manual_trade.py` and they don't care what the SL percentage is - they just receive the price and submit it.\n\nIt won't break anything. It just widens the SL from 1% to 2% for all new positions. The only change is the calculated SL price value, not the order submission logic.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"不影响订单流程。`crypto_signal_monitor.py` 里的 `calc_tp_sl` 只负责**计算**止损价是多少，订单真正提交走的是 `binance_auto_trade.py`，它不管 SL 是 1% 还是 2%，只管把收到的价格丢给币安。\n\n改 2% 的效果就是：新开的每个单，SL 价格从 `入场价 ±1%` 变成 `入场价 ±2%`。就这么简单。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":511,"output":1051,"cacheRead":64384,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":65946,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779780552663}}
