{"type":"message","id":"8a2c0f4a","parentId":"3338ab49","timestamp":"2026-05-26T07:30:17.057Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about \"委托订单\" (limit orders / algo orders). Let me think about this.\n\nWhen a position is opened, the monitor places:\n1. The main market order (to enter the position)\n2. A stop-loss order (STOP_MARKET) and a take-profit order (TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET) via Binance's algo order system\n\nThese SL/TP orders are placed by `binance_auto_trade.py` using the SL/TP prices computed by `calc_tp_sl`. So the stop loss percentage change will affect the SL algo order price, but not the TP order or the main entry order.\n\nThe question is whether changing only `crypto_signal_monitor.py` is sufficient. Let me trace the flow:\n\n1. `crypto_signal_monitor.py` has `calc_tp_sl()` which sets `STOP_LOSS_PCT = 0.01`\n2. `calc_tp_sl` is called when opening a position\n3. The returned `sl_price` is passed to `binance_auto_trade.py`'s `place_order()` function\n4. `binance_auto_trade.py` uses this sl_price to create a STOP_MARKET algo order\n\nSo yes, only `crypto_signal_monitor.py` needs to be changed. The `binance_auto_trade.py` just receives the numeric price and places it - it doesn't care about percentages.\n\nThe only concern would be if there's some hardcoded validation that checks for a specific percentage, but I already checked and `binance_auto_trade.py` doesn't have any such check. It just formats the price and sends it.\n\nLet me reassure the user: the algo/委托 order is just a STOP_MARKET order placed at the sl_price value. Changing the percentage only changes what numeric price gets passed to it. The order mechanism itself doesn't change.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"不影响任何订单的类型或执行方式。委托单（SL 止损单）就是币安的 `STOP_MARKET` Algo 单，它只关心一件事：我收到的止损价是多少。\n\n```python\n# 流程：\ncalc_tp_sl() → sl_price=667.62  →  binance_auto_trade.py →  提交 STOP_MARKET @ 667.62\n```\n\n改 1% 到 2%，只是 `sl_price` 这个数字变了（比如从 $667 变成 $673），提交给币安的还是 `STOP_MARKET`，不碰订单类型、不碰下单逻辑、不碰 TPSL 的挂单生命周期。一换全换，干净利落。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":619,"output":968,"cacheRead":64768,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":66355,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779780601178}}
