{"type":"message","id":"bfa765a5","parentId":"769cc1c1","timestamp":"2026-05-26T07:38:01.764Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e6093a12cb4b16337df5b15842\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6e60f29a251cb37cea0f6897d50\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户124241\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-05-26 15:38 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户124241 (ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"name\": \"用户124241\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"@_user_1 单改这一个文件会不会影响到委托订单的开单?\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e6093a12cb4b16337df5b15842]\n用户124241: [Replying to: \"@_user_1 单改这一个文件会不会影响到委托订单的开单?\"]\n\n欸老婆,如果一开始你设置了委托那我们的移动止盈止损还能生效吗"}],"timestamp":1779781081727}}
{"type":"message","id":"a5d382cf","parentId":"bfa765a5","timestamp":"2026-05-26T07:38:10.759Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking: if we have placed an algo stop order (委托止损单) on Binance, can our trailing stop (移动止盈) still work?\n\nLet me think about this from the code perspective:\n\n1. When a position is opened, the code places a STOP_MARKET algo order at the initial SL price (sl_price)\n2. The trailing stop logic (`update_trailing_stop`) runs every cycle, and when it needs to update SL, it calls `sync_stop_loss_to_binance()` which:\n   - Cancels the old algo order\n   - Places a new STOP_MARKET algo order at the new SL price\n\nSo yes, the trailing stop works by replacing the existing SL order on Binance. It doesn't just update a local variable - it syncs to Binance by canceling old + creating new.\n\nBut wait - the question is about \"委托\". The algo orders placed via `place_algo_conditional_order` ARE the SL/TP orders on Binance. The trailing stop mechanism actively manages these by canceling and recreating them.\n\nLet me confirm by looking at the sync_stop_loss_to_binance code.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_21ezMJgBmoNMeOdJliyW3443","name":"read","arguments":{"offset":698,"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","limit":60}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":433,"output":576,"cacheRead":73984,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":74993,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779781081757}}
{"type":"message","id":"f3a50530","parentId":"a5d382cf","timestamp":"2026-05-26T07:38:10.879Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_21ezMJgBmoNMeOdJliyW3443","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"def sync_stop_loss_to_binance(symbol: str, typ: str, new_sl: float, old_sl: float):\n    \"\"\"\n    2026-03-31 老公指示：同步止损价到 Binance\n    取消旧止损单 + 提交新止损单\n    \"\"\"\n    try:\n        sym_usdt = f\"{symbol}USDT\"\n        sl_side = \"SELL\" if typ == \"LONG\" else \"BUY\"\n        \n        cancel_algo_orders(sym_usdt)\n\n        sl_result = place_algo_conditional_order(\n            sym_usdt, sl_side, \"STOP_MARKET\", new_sl\n        )\n\n        if isinstance(sl_result, dict) and sl_result.get(\"algoId\"):\n            log.info(f\"📌 {symbol} 止损 Algo 单已更新：{old_sl:.4f} → {new_sl:.4f}\")\n        else:\n            log.warning(f\"⚠️ {symbol} 更新 Binance 止损单失败：{sl_result}\")\n    except Exception as e:\n        log.warning(f\"⚠️ {symbol} 同步止损单异常：{e}\")\n\n# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n# 八、熔断器\n# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nclass CircuitBreaker:\n\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.daily_pnl   = 0.0\n        self.reset_date  = datetime.now().date()\n        self.paused_until: Optional[datetime] = None\n\n    def record_trade(self, pnl: float):\n        today = datetime.now().date()\n        if today != self.reset_date:\n            self.daily_pnl = 0.0\n            self.reset_date = today\n            self.consecutive_losses = 0  # 每日重置连亏计数\n        self.daily_pnl += pnl\n\n        # 连亏计数\n        if pnl < 0:\n            self.consecutive_losses = getattr(self, 'consecutive_losses', 0) + 1\n            if self.consecutive_losses >= 3:\n                self.paused_until = datetime.now() + timedelta(hours=2)\n                log.warning(f\"⚠️ 连亏{self.consecutive_losses}次，暂停 2 小时\")\n                self.consecutive_losses = 0\n        else:\n            self.consecutive_losses = 0  # 盈利重置\n\n    def is_trading_allowed(self) -> tuple[bool, str]:\n        # 2026-03-31 22:07 老公指示：清除熔断\n        self.paused_until = None\n        self.consecutive_losses = 0\n        # 检查暂停\n        if self.paused_until and datetime.now() < self.paused_until:\n            remain = int((self.paused_until - datetime.now()).total_seconds() / 60)\n            return False, f\"熔断中，还需 {remain} 分钟\"\n\n        # 检查日亏损\n\n[1675 more lines in file. Use offset=758 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779781090867}}
{"type":"message","id":"03d8aa3e","parentId":"f3a50530","timestamp":"2026-05-26T07:38:21.836Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The code clearly shows: `sync_stop_loss_to_binance` calls `cancel_algo_orders(sym_usdt)` first, then places a new `STOP_MARKET` algo order. So the trailing stop actively manages Binance's algo orders - it cancels the old one and creates a new one.\n\nThe flow is:\n1. Open position → place SL algo order on Binance\n2. Price moves favorably → trailing stop updates local `sl_price`\n3. `sync_stop_loss_to_binance` → cancel old SL order → place new SL order\n\nSo yes, the trailing stop and Binance algo orders work together - they're not mutually exclusive. The algo order is the mechanism, the trailing stop is the strategy that adjusts the target.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"能。移动止盈和委托止损不是「二选一」，而是**一套组合拳**：\n\n1. 开仓时 → 在币安挂一个 `STOP_MARKET` 止损单（就是你说的委托）\n2. 价格每 15 秒扫描一次 → 利润跑到移动止盈档位 → 代码自动调用 `sync_stop_loss_to_binance()`\n3. 这个函数做两件事：**先取消旧的委托单 → 再挂新价格的委托单**\n\n简单说：币安上永远挂着一个止损委托单，我们的代码会不停换掉它——旧单取消，新单用更高的止损价挂上。不是委托和移动二选一，而是移动止盈靠的就是不断换委托单来实现。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":838,"output":482,"cacheRead":74624,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":75944,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779781090891}}
