{"type":"message","id":"65657656","parentId":"c11f19c6","timestamp":"2026-05-26T07:44:08.649Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_ET_6SGsxyPpMA02YEHVKnXV5684","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"        print(\"⚠️ 这是预览（DRY RUN），未真实下单\")\n        print(\"✅ 确认无误请加 --confirm 重新执行\")\n        return\n\n    import binance_auto_trade as bat\n    print(\"\\n🚀 真实下单中...\")\n    result = bat.place_order(\n        symbol=f\"{symbol}USDT\",\n        side=side,\n        quantity=quantity,\n        leverage=leverage,\n        price=price,\n        reduce_only=False,\n    )\n    if result.get(\"success\"):\n        print(f\"✅ 开仓成功: {result.get('order')}\")\n    else:\n        print(f\"❌ 开仓失败: {result.get('message')}\")\n        print(f\"   原始返回: {result.get('order')}\")\n\n\ndef cmd_close(args: list):\n    if not args:\n        print(\"[ERROR] 用法: close <币种>\")\n        sys.exit(1)\n    symbol = args[0].upper()\n    import binance_auto_trade as bat\n    pos = bat.get_position(f\"{symbol}USDT\")\n    if not pos or pos[\"amount\"] == 0:\n        print(f\"📭 {symbol} 当前无持仓\")\n\n[87 more lines in file. Use offset=140 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779781448627}}
{"type":"message","id":"3cb812d6","parentId":"65657656","timestamp":"2026-05-26T07:44:22.922Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK I see the issue. `manual_trade.py` calls `bat.place_order()` WITHOUT passing `tp_price` and `sl_price`! It only passes `symbol`, `side`, `quantity`, `leverage`, `price`, and `reduce_only`. \n\nSo when opening via manual_trade, **no TP/SL are set at all** — the position opens without any stop-loss order on Binance! This is a gap. The monitor's own signal-based opening would use `calc_tp_sl()` and set TP/SL, but manual_trade doesn't.\n\nThis means the ETH position just opened has NO stop-loss at all. The user wanted to test the 2% SL but the manual trade didn't set any SL.\n\nI should tell the user this. The ETH long is open but WITHOUT any SL/TP. Let me rectify this by placing the SL and TP algo orders now.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"开是开成功了，但有个问题——`manual_trade.py` 没传 TP/SL 给 `place_order`，也就是说这个 ETH 多单**没有挂止损止盈**。\n\n让我补一下："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_jDPf048N6yvGmFpzktwW3071","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace && python3 -c \"\nimport sys\nsys.path.insert(0, 'scripts')\nfrom crypto_signal_monitor import calc_tp_sl\nfrom binance_auto_trade import place_algo_conditional_order, cancel_algo_orders, request\n\n# ETH 入场价\npos = request('GET', '/fapi/v1/positionRisk', {'symbol': 'ETHUSDT'})\nif isinstance(pos, list) and pos:\n    entry = float(pos[0]['entryPrice'])\n    amt = float(pos[0]['positionAmt'])\n    print(f'ETH 入场: \\${entry}  数量: {amt}')\n    \n    # 用新 2% SL 重新算\n    tp_sl = calc_tp_sl(entry, 'LONG', {}, {})\n    tp = tp_sl['tp1_price']\n    sl = tp_sl['sl_price']\n    print(f'TP(4%): \\${tp}  SL(2%): \\${sl}')\n    \n    # 清除旧挂单\n    cancel_algo_orders('ETHUSDT')\n    \n    # 挂新 SL\n    sl_r = place_algo_conditional_order('ETHUSDT', 'SELL', 'STOP_MARKET', sl)\n    print(f'SL单: {sl_r.get(\\\"algoId\\\", \\\"失败\\\")}' if isinstance(sl_r, dict) else f'SL失败: {sl_r}')\n    \n    # 挂新 TP\n    tp_r = place_algo_conditional_order('ETHUSDT', 'SELL', 'TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET', tp)\n    print(f'TP单: {tp_r.get(\\\"algoId\\\", \\\"失败\\\")}' if isinstance(tp_r, dict) else f'TP失败: {tp_r}')\n\" 2>&1 | grep -v 'InsecureRequest\\|warnings.warn\\|urllib3\\|INFO\\]'","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":396,"output":903,"cacheRead":79744,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":81043,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779781448686}}
