{"type":"message","id":"312109c0","parentId":"a1d19e28","timestamp":"2026-05-26T07:46:34.844Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Success! Both SL and TP algo orders were placed. The ETH position now has:\n- Entry: $2095.17\n- SL: $2053.27 (2% below)\n- TP: $2178.98 (4% above)\n\nAnd the manual_trade.py has a bug - it doesn't set TP/SL when opening positions. I should tell the user about this gap.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"ETH 多单已补上委托 ✅\n\n```\nETH LONG  入场 $2095.17  止损 $2053(-2%)  止盈 $2179(+4%)\n```\n\n不过我发现了一个 bug——`manual_trade.py` 开仓时根本没传 TP/SL，刚才这个 ETH 开出来是裸奔的。信号监控那边的开单是正常的（走 `calc_tp_sl`），但手动开仓缺了这一环，要不要修？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":575,"output":263,"cacheRead":83840,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":84678,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779781588903}}
