{"type":"message","id":"45a0e685","parentId":"bfd53687","timestamp":"2026-05-26T07:48:20.831Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking why ETC and BNB didn't have this problem (missing TP/SL) but ETH did. Let me think about this:\n\n- BNB SHORT was opened by the signal monitor via `binance_auto_trade.place_order()` with TP/SL calculated by `calc_tp_sl()`. The monitor's `binance_auto_trade.place_order()` DOES pass `tp_price` and `sl_price` - as we can see from the code we read earlier (line 406+).\n\n- ETC LONG was opened by my inline Python script which also explicitly used `place_order('ETCUSDT', 'BUY', quantity, ..., tp_price=tp, sl_price=sl, price=price)`. I explicitly passed TP and SL.\n\n- ETH LONG was opened by `manual_trade.py` which calls `bat.place_order()` without passing `tp_price` or `sl_price` (only `symbol`, `side`, `quantity`, `leverage`, `price`, `reduce_only`).\n\nSo the difference is:\n- BNB: opened by monitor → passes TP/SL\n- ETC: opened by my inline script → explicitly passes TP/SL\n- ETH: opened by manual_trade.py → does NOT pass TP/SL (bug)\n\nThe user is right to ask why BNB and ETC were fine.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"BNB 和 ETC 都不是走 `manual_trade.py` 开的：\n\n- **BNB**：信号监控自动开单，走的是 `binance_auto_trade.place_order()` 带了 `tp_price` 和 `sl_price`，两参数由 `calc_tp_sl()` 算好\n- **ETC**：刚才我临时写的脚本开的，我也手动传了 TP/SL 进去\n- **ETH**：唯一走 `manual_trade.py open` 命令的，这文件里只传了 `symbol/side/quantity/leverage/price`，没传 TP/SL\n\n所以不是某些币没问题某些有，是**只有 `manual_trade.py` 这个入口漏了**。监控自动单和手动脚本都没这个问题。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":503,"output":740,"cacheRead":84480,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":85723,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779781689345}}
