{"type":"message","id":"d958e037","parentId":"0e945629","timestamp":"2026-05-26T07:58:54.462Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking if RSI is a K-line (candlestick). No, they're different things. RSI is a momentum indicator, K-line is a candlestick chart representation.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"不是。K 线是单根蜡烛图，记录一段时间内的**开高低收**四个价。\n\nRSI 是动量指标，取值 0-100，衡量**价格涨跌的速度和幅度**，用来判断超买超卖。简单版：\n\n- RSI > 70 → 超买，可能回调\n- RSI < 30 → 超卖，可能反弹\n- RSI 40-60 → 中性震荡，没方向\n\n现在 7 个币种全在 41-55 之间，就是没方向。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":311,"output":201,"cacheRead":94336,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":94848,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779782328733}}
