{"type":"message","id":"ff70efb9","parentId":"88aa8348","timestamp":"2026-05-26T07:59:41.097Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking if I can see 24h high/low data. I got N/A earlier because _fetch_24h_tickers only returns price, change_24h, and volume. But the full Binance ticker endpoint has high_24h and low_24h. Let me fetch it directly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"能看，刚用的接口字段不够。重拉一下："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_SZcWd4e9ObxmWGAVqzua8036","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 << 'PYEOF'\nimport crypto_signal_monitor as m\nfrom binance_auto_trade import request\n\nfor sym in m.CONFIG['symbols']:\n    try:\n        tk = request('GET', '/fapi/v1/ticker/24hr', {'symbol': f'{sym}USDT'})\n        if isinstance(tk, dict):\n            price = float(tk['lastPrice'])\n            high = float(tk['highPrice'])\n            low = float(tk['lowPrice'])\n            chg = float(tk['priceChangePercent'])\n            print(f'{sym:5s} \\${price:>10.2f}  24h高\\${high:<10.2f}  24h低\\${low:<10.2f}  {chg:+.2f}%')\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f'{sym}: {e}')\nPYEOF\n","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":466,"output":407,"cacheRead":94592,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":95465,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779782373629}}
