                                       \"high_24h\":   float(t[\"h\"]),\n192:                                        \"low_24h\":    float(t[\"l\"]),\n194:                                        \"change_24h\": chg_pct,\n229:                        'change_24h': 0.0,\n234:                            f'https://testnet.binancefuture.com/fapi/v1/ticker/24hr?symbol={sym}USDT',\n241:                            entry['change_24h'] = float(t.get('priceChangePercent', 0))\n289:    def get_24h_klines(self, symbol: str) -> list:\n290:        \"\"\"Get 24h klines with 3-layer fallback\"\"\"\n291:        # 1. Binance 1h klines (60 bars = 24h)\n296:        # 2. Binance 测试网期货 24hr Ticker\n299:                f\"{CONFIG['binance_futures']}/ticker/24hr\",\n316:            log.warning(f\"24hr Ticker failed {symbol}: {e}\")\n319:        log.error(f\"24h klines failed all fallbacks {symbol}\")\n364:        klines_1h  = self.get_24h_klines(symbol)\n510:    # 成交量：优先 15m K 线 vol_current（与 vol_avg20 同量纲），避免 WS 24h 量纲不一致\n867:24h 涨跌：{price_data.get('change_24h')}%","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779782543546}}
{"type":"message","id":"5533f2aa","parentId":"23314fdb","timestamp":"2026-05-26T08:02:29.246Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Looking at this:\n\n1. The price data DOES include `high_24h` and `low_24h` (lines 191-192, from WebSocket ticker)\n2. BUT the `calc_score` function doesn't use 24h high/low directly in scoring - it uses resistance/support from indicators instead\n3. 24h change is used (line 867, in AI predictor context)\n\nLet me also check how calc_score uses the data.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_plETZAgQi83BXn7paenv2024","name":"read","arguments":{"offset":493,"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","limit":70}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":461,"output":284,"cacheRead":98304,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":99049,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779782543584}}
{"type":"message","id":"84579289","parentId":"5533f2aa","timestamp":"2026-05-26T08:02:29.306Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_plETZAgQi83BXn7paenv2024","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"def calc_score(\n    symbol: str,\n    price_data: dict,\n    ind: dict,\n    regime: str,\n    fg: int,\n    funding_rate: float,\n    btc_ind: dict,  # 2026-03-28 老公指示：用 BTC 作为大盘参考\n) -> tuple[int, str]:\n    \"\"\"\n    返回 (score, direction)\n    direction: 'LONG' | 'SHORT' | 'NONE'\n    \"\"\"\n    if not ind or not price_data:\n        return 0, \"NONE\"\n\n    price      = float(price_data.get(\"price\") or ind.get(\"last_close\") or 0)\n    # 成交量：优先 15m K 线 vol_current（与 vol_avg20 同量纲），避免 WS 24h 量纲不一致\n    vol        = float(ind.get(\"vol_current\") or price_data.get(\"volume\") or 0)\n    vol_avg    = ind[\"vol_avg20\"]\n    atr_pct    = ind[\"atr_pct\"]\n    resistance = ind[\"resistance\"]\n    support    = ind[\"support\"]\n\n    long_score  = 0\n    short_score = 0\n\n    # ① 价格突破（40 分）\n    if price >= resistance * 0.999:\n        long_score += 40\n    if price <= support * 1.001:\n        short_score += 40\n\n    # ② 成交量放大确认（30 分）\n    if vol > vol_avg * 1.5:\n        long_score  += 30\n        short_score += 30\n    elif vol > vol_avg * 1.2:\n        long_score  += 15\n        short_score += 15\n\n    # ③ ATR 波动率适中（20 分）\n    if 0.005 < atr_pct < 0.03:\n        long_score  += 20\n        short_score += 20\n\n    # ④ BTC 大盘方向（10 分）- 2026-03-28 老公指示：用 BTC 代替 ETH\n    _btc = btc_ind if btc_ind else {}\n    if _btc:\n        btc_bull = _btc.get(\"ema20_15m\", 0) > _btc.get(\"ema60_15m\", 0)\n        if btc_bull:\n            long_score  += 10\n            short_score -= 5\n        else:\n            short_score += 10\n            long_score  -= 5\n\n    long_score  = max(0, long_score)\n    short_score = max(0, short_score)\n\n    threshold = CONFIG[\"score_threshold\"][regime]\n    if long_score > short_score and long_score >= threshold:\n        return long_score, \"LONG\"\n    elif short_score > long_score and short_score >= threshold:\n        return short_score, \"SHORT\"\n\n    return max(long_score, short_score), \"NONE\"\n\n\ndef calc_tp_sl(\n\n[1870 more lines in file. Use offset=563 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779782549298}}
{"type":"message","id":"7b285b5d","parentId":"84579289","timestamp":"2026-05-26T08:02:37.136Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So `calc_score` uses:\n1. Price vs resistance/support (40 points) - these come from indicators which reference 24h high/low indirectly\n2. Volume confirmation (30 points) \n3. ATR volatility (20 points)\n4. BTC trend (10 points)\n\nIt does NOT directly use 24h high/low in the scoring. The resistance/support are indicator-calculated levels, not simply the 24h high/low.\n\nHowever, `price_data` does carry `high_24h` and `low_24h` (from WebSocket), they're just not used in the scoring formula. They might be used elsewhere though.\n\nLet me also check if 24h high/low are used in the TP/SL calculation or indicator calculation.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"**不直接用。** 评分系统只用这四个维度：\n\n1. 价格 vs 阻力/支撑（40分）— 由指标引擎算，间接参考 24h 价格范围\n2. 成交量放大确认（30分）\n3. ATR 波动率（20分）\n4. BTC 大盘方向（10分）\n\nWebSocket 其实拿到了 `high_24h` 和 `low_24h`，但没有参与评分。24h 高低的角色是**背景参考**，不是入场条件。\n\n要用上的话也不难——比如「当前价比 24h 高点低超过 5% → 加分做多」，要加吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":681,"output":457,"cacheRead":98944,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":100082,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779782549318}}
{"type":"message","id":"07ebd980","parentId":"7b285b5d","timestamp":"2026-05-26T08:03:30.115Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e6173c6c0b8b11ec40b3b5c183\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户124241\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-05-26 16:03 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户124241 (ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"name\": \"用户124241\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e6173c6c0b8b11ec40b3b5c183]\n用户124241: 你觉得需要吗"}],"timestamp":1779782610078}}
{"type":"message","id":"d873a9bd","parentId":"07ebd980","timestamp":"2026-05-26T08:03:41.989Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking for my opinion on whether we should add 24h high/low to the scoring system. Let me think about this:\n\nPros:\n- 24h high/low give context on what range price has been in recently\n- Price near 24h low could indicate reversal opportunity\n- Helps filter out signals that are at extreme ends of the daily range\n\nCons:\n- Resistance/support already partially capture this information\n- In trending markets, 24h high/low keep breaking - using them as signals would give false readings\n- Our current scoring is already quite balanced with 4 components\n- Adding another dimension complicates the model without necessarily improving win rate\n\nI think it could be useful as a **filter** rather than a scoring component:\n- Don't use it to add points\n- Use it to WARN/KILL signals that are at extreme levels\n\nFor example: \"If price is at 24h high and scoring says SHORT, that's extra confirmation. If price is at 24h low and scoring says LONG, same thing.\"\n\nBut adding points based on this could be noisy. My honest opinion: not needed as a scoring factor, but potentially useful as a sanity check filter.\n\nLet me give a brief, honest opinion.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"说实话说—**不需要**。\n\n原因是阻力/支撑位已经覆盖了这个功能。24h 高 ≈ 当日阻力，24h 低 ≈ 当日支撑，而现在的评分第①项已经在看「价格是否突破阻力/支撑」了。再加一个维度会变成同一种信息被打两次分，反而让信号偏斜。\n\n但如果硬要用的话，当**过滤器**比当**加分项**合理——比如「价格贴在 24h 高附近时不给做多信号」，这样不虚增分数，只挡住不合理的反向开单。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":373,"output":628,"cacheRead":99840,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":100841,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779782610100}}
{"type":"message","id":"ee0f6b1a","parentId":"d873a9bd","timestamp":"2026-05-26T08:05:04.225Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e610c216ce0b35c22e3c5d6efb\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户124241\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-05-26 16:05 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户124241 (ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"name\": \"用户124241\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e610c216ce0b35c22e3c5d6efb]\n用户124241: 可以追高吗我们的策略?"}],"timestamp":1779782704185}}
{"type":"message","id":"59886bb5","parentId":"ee0f6b1a","timestamp":"2026-05-26T08:05:16.611Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking whether our strategy supports \"chasing highs\" (追高) - i.e., buying when price is already high/rising, or selling short when price is already low/falling.\n\nLet me think about this. Our scoring system:\n- LONG score gets +40 if price >= resistance (breaking above resistance → chase the breakout)\n- SHORT score gets +40 if price <= support (breaking below support → chase the breakdown)\n\nSo yes, the strategy DOES support chasing breakouts. The \"price breakthrough\" dimension gives 40 points for breaking resistance (LONG) or support (SHORT). This is essentially chasing momentum.\n\nBut there's no filter that prevents opening when price is already at extremes. So currently it can chase.\n\nLet me be honest about this.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"可以，而且已经在做了。评分的第①项就是追突破——价格突破阻力→加 40 分做多，跌破支撑→加 40 分做空。这就是典型的追高/追低策略，赌的是突破持续性。\n\n问题在于没有安全阀：如果价格已经在 24h 高点附近挂着了，稍微突一下就给 40 分开多，容易买在山顶。不过我们还有 ATR 和成交量确认兜底——这两项不合格分数凑不够，也开不出去。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":526,"output":428,"cacheRead":100096,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":101050,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779782704211}}
