{"type":"message","id":"86fc53be","parentId":"c7c1fdbc","timestamp":"2026-05-26T10:58:05.074Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"BNB is gone, no positions at all. The balance is 5021.18 USDT. Let me check what happened - was BNB stopped out or did it close at profit?\n\nEarlier BNB was at entry $656.6, last I saw it was at $658.1 or so. If it got stopped out, it was probably at 1% SL (the old SL before the change). Let me check.\n\nBNB SHORT entry $656.6, old SL (1%) = $656.6 * 1.01 = $663.17. \n\nWait, the SL was set to the old 1% because the BNB position was opened before I changed the code to 2%. So the BNB had SL at $663.17 for SHORT.\n\nBut also, BNB was the only survivor from earlier. Let me check if it was stopped or if something else happened.\n\nActually, the user just ran and came back. Let me just tell them BNB is gone and focus on what happened. The balance went from 5003 to 5021, so it seems like BNB closed with a small profit or near breakeven.\n\nLet me check recent trades.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_ZpSdPuP5z7LtWy9YyBwG6857","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nfrom binance_auto_trade import request\nimport time\nfrom datetime import datetime\n\nsince_ms = int((time.time() - 7200) * 1000)\ntrades = request('GET', '/fapi/v1/userTrades', {'symbol': 'BNBUSDT', 'startTime': since_ms, 'limit': 10})\nif isinstance(trades, list):\n    for t in trades:\n        ts = datetime.fromtimestamp(t['time']/1000).strftime('%H:%M:%S')\n        qty = float(t['qty'])\n        price = float(t['price'])\n        side = t['side']\n        pnl = t.get('realizedPnl', '')\n        print(f'{ts} {side} {qty}@{price} PnL={pnl}')\nelse:\n    print('无成交:', trades)\n\" 2>&1 | grep -v 'InsecureRequest\\|warnings.warn\\|urllib3\\|INFO'","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":162,"