{"type":"compaction","id":"758b95d1","parentId":"2d88deba","timestamp":"2026-05-26T14:04:08.495Z","summary":"## Goal\n用户在 Binance 测试盘环境中管理加密货币交易监控系统，主要任务包括：排查下单失败原因、监控系统健康状态、优化止损策略（从 1% 调整到 2%）。\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- 全部走 Binance Testnet（`testnet.binancefuture.com`），不是实盘\n- 用户自称「老公」，称呼 AI 为「老婆」\n- 用户偏好：先分析再改代码，改动要最小化\n- 用户会自己写手动暂停交易的功能，不需要 AI 实现\n- CoinGecko 暂不接入（用户说「接上了也开不了单」）\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] 排查 BNB 开多失败：-1007 是币安测试网后端超时，非我方问题\n- [x] 健康检查（12/12 全绿），但发现检查粒度不够（未实际下单验证）\n- [x] 确认价格来源：仅 Binance Futures Testnet WebSocket + REST 兜底\n- [x] 测试网恢复后确认持仓（4 个，后被打掉 3 个只剩 BNB）\n- [x] 分析止损被扫的三单（SOL/XRP/LINK）实际亏损约 0.8%\n- [x] 将止损从 1% 改为 2%，修改 9 处代码并重启 monitor\n\n### In Progress\n- [ ] (none active)\n\n### Blocked\n- [ ] 健康检查加真实下单验证 — 未实施\n- [ ] 手动暂停交易开关 — 用户打算自己写\n\n## Key Decisions\n- **止损从 1% → 2%**：加密波动率高，1% 噪音反弹太容易触发止损。2% 在 10x 杠杆下仍可接受（盈亏比 2:1）\n- **只改 `crypto_signal_monitor.py` 一个文件**：`calc_tp_sl()` 是唯一计算止损价的地方，`manual_trade.py` 和 `binance_auto_trade.py` 只接收价格不自己计算\n- **移动止盈不受影响**：三档移动止盈（2%/3%/4% 利润触发回撤锁仓）基于 peak_pnl 判断，不依赖 STOP_LOSS_PCT\n\n## Next Steps\n1. 用户可能后续测试 2% 止损效果\n2. 用户计划自己写手动暂停交易代码（文件锁方案）\n3. 健康检查需补充真实下单验证（待定）\n\n## Critical Context\n- **修改的文件**：`/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py`，共 9 处\n  - L576: `STOP_LOSS_PCT = 0.02`（核心）\n  - L581/584 注释更新\n  - L2048/2069 注释更新\n  - L2158: 硬编码 `0.008` → `0.02`（恢复持仓兜底 SL）\n  - L2333: 熔断阈值 `-0.01` → `-0.02`\n- **当前持仓**：仅 BNB SHORT -0.3 @ $656.6（余额 $5003.70），其余三个（SOL/XRP/LINK）已被 1% SL 扫掉\n- **Monitor 进程重启后 PID 27448**\n- 币安测试网偶发后端超时（-1007），属测试网本身不稳定，实盘不会出现\n\n---\n\n**Turn Context (split turn):**\n\n## Decisions\n- The user clarified they wanted to open an **ETH (Ethereum)** long, not ETC (Ethereum Classic).\n- Assistant executed `manual_trade.py` to open ETH LONG with 20 USDT margin @ 10x leverage (entry ~$2094.98, qty 0.095).\n- The trade succeeded (orderId: 8734138678), but no TP/SL were set because `manual_trade.py` does not pass `tp_price`/`sl_price` to `binance_auto_trade.place_order()`.\n- Decision: need to retroactively place SL (2%) and TP (4%) algo orders for the open ETH position.\n\n## Open TODOs\n- [ ] Successfully place a STOP_MARKET SL algo order at the 2% stop price.\n- [ ] Successfully place a TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET TP algo order at the 4% take-profit price.\n- [ ] Consider modifying `manual_trade.py` to include TP/SL in the future (gap noted).\n\n## Constraints/Rules\n- None explicitly stated by user; assistant operates on Binance testnet/proxy via local REST API at `127.0.0.1`.\n- Positions are on `ETHUSDT` perpetual.\n- SL is 2% of entry, TP is 4% of entry (as per `calc_tp_sl`).\n\n## Pending user asks\n- The user's direct message (\"My bad, we want ETH not ETC\") has been actioned; the unblocked but failed SL/TP fix is a follow-up from the assistant's own observation.\n\n## Exact identifiers\n- File: `~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/manual_trade.py`\n- File: `~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py` (contains `calc_tp_sl`)\n- File: `~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/binance_auto_trade.py` (contains `place_order`, `place_algo_conditional_order`, `cancel_algo_orders`, `request`)\n- Order ID: `8734138678`\n- Symbol: `ETHUSDT`\n- Session IDs: `plaid-cedar` (manual trade process), `crisp-lobster` (SL/TP fix attempt)\n- API key prefix: `4XOtZh5r...10XU` (from auto_trade_config.json)\n- Timestamp of opening: `2026-05-26 15:43:50` (updateTime `1779781430647`)\n- Entry price: `$2094.98`, quantity: `0.095`, leverage: `10x`\n- First SL/TP fix attempt: process `crisp-lobster`, exited code 1, no output beyond urllib3 warning\n- The second SL/TP fix attempt is still running/hung as of the snippet cut-off (no conclusive output)\n\n## Recent turns preserved verbatim\n- User: Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e60803c74ecb11fa834cf4979a\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6e60f29a251cb37cea0f6897d50\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"conversation_label\": 