{"type":"message","id":"9cc8eea8","parentId":"4bab13ba","timestamp":"2026-05-26T15:40:20.682Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking what happens when context (conversation history) exceeds the limit. Let me explain this clearly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"会触发**压缩**（compaction）——把长对话历史压成一段摘要，新的对话继续挂在摘要后面。\n\n就像刚才那个 \"The conversation history before this point was compacted into the following summary\" 的块，那就是压缩结果。压缩后的摘要会保留关键信息（做了什么、改了什么、决定是什么），但一些闲聊细节就丢了。\n\n所以我养成了习惯：**重要的事立刻写进文件**，不靠记忆——文件不会丢，上下文会。</parameter>"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":521,"output":151,"cacheRead":58240,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":58912,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779810015518}}
